Instance: loader-settings
InstanceOf: Parameters
Usage: #example
Title: "Loader settings"
Description: "Read by the loader, never loaded. anchorDate is the day the scenario is written for: it maps to the load date, and every date in the data shifts by the same number of days."
* parameter[+].name = "anchorDate"
* parameter[=].valueDate = "2026-01-01"
